{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:stopIndicator:helperText:gapSize:animated:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:helperText:helperTextAlignment:gapSize:accessibility:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/body"]},{"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextAlignment","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Indicators"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Variants","text":"Variants","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the caller provides a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" value in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"text":". Values outside this range are coerced.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"completion time or percentage.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"text":": no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the interface is frozen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Statuses","text":"Statuses","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onboarding)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}]},{"text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retrieval).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}]},{"text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monitored.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}]},{"text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Gap-size","text":"Gap size","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}]},{"text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Track","type":"heading","anchor":"Track","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)","type":"heading","anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it."}]},{"text":"Helper text","type":"heading","anchor":"Helper-text","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the progress bar to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"},{"text":" which offers two variants:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter controls horizontal alignment (","type":"text"},{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".percent(description:alignment:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The percentage value and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75%\""},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"type":"text","text":" in Arabic)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"text":" (default), only the percentage is shown, centered.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"text":", the percentage is at the leading edge and the description (if provided) at the trailing edge.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"text":", the description (if provided) is at the leading edge and the percentage at the trailing edge.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"text":" with a separate ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperTextAlignment"},{"text":" parameter:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (default): The text is centered under the progress bar."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the leading edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Animation","type":"heading","anchor":"Animation","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}]},{"text":": when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the target ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"text":"Determinate — Basic usage","type":"heading","anchor":"Determinate-Basic-usage","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: .description(\"Uploading…\"))","","    \/\/ Description aligned to the end","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\", alignment: .end))","","    \/\/ Percentage centered (default)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .percent())","","    \/\/ Percentage with description at start (percentage leading, description trailing)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                helperText: .percent(description: \"of 100 MB\", alignment: .start))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")","","    \/\/ Helper text aligned to the end","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                helperText: \"Loading data…\",","                                helperTextAlignment: .end)","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with accessibility","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"loading\", state: \"processing\"))"],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"VoiceOver reads: ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]"}]},{"text":". Example: ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}]},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".updatesFrequently"},{"text":" trait so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" is provided, it is exposed as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”"}]},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The indicator never captures ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}]},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"text":" trait is used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Colored surfaces","type":"heading","anchor":"Colored-surfaces","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"monochrome","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 3.0.0","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolinearprogressindicator"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"role":"symbol","title":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents27MISOLinearProgressIndicatorV"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A linear indicator shows the progress of a task using a horizontal line."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Best used inside layouts to show progress.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOLinearProgressIndicator/View-Implementations":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","title":"View Implementations","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolinearprogressindicator\/view-implementations"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It cont